								"@type": "Answer",
								"text": "Under the LTFRB nationwide fare adjustment effective September 28, 2026, the minimum regular base fare for Traditional Public Utility Jeepneys (TPUJ) is ₱14.00 for the first 4 kilometers (₱2.00 per succeeding kilometer), with a 20% discounted base fare of ₱11.20. For Modern Public Utility Jeepneys (MPUJ), the regular base fare is ₱17.00 for the first 4 kilometers (₱2.40 per succeeding kilometer), with a 20% discounted base fare of ₱13.60."
							}
