							"acceptedAnswer": {
								"@type": "Answer",
								"text": "Yes! Under Republic Act No. 11314 (Student Fare Discount Act) and LTFRB MC 2017-024, all Filipino students from elementary to college/vocational levels are legally entitled to a 20% discount 365 days a year, including weekends, semester breaks, and national holidays. The driver or conductor cannot refuse the discount upon presentation of a valid student ID."
							}
						},
