			<!-- Section 7: Frequently Asked Questions -->
			<section class="mb-10 font-sans border-t border-mapa-contour/40 pt-8">
				<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-mapa-ink mb-4">
					7. Frequently Asked Questions on Philippine Commute Fares
				</h3>
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/80">
						<h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-mapa-green mb-2">
							What is the official base fare for jeepneys in 2026?
						</h4>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mapa-ink/85 leading-relaxed">
							Under the September 28, 2026 LTFRB fare adjustment, the regular base fare for Traditional PUJs is ₱14.00 for the first 4 km (₱2.00 per succeeding km), with a 20% discounted base fare of ₱11.20 (₱1.60 per succeeding km). For Modern PUJs, the regular base fare is ₱17.00 for the first 4 km (₱2.40 per succeeding km), with a discounted base fare of ₱13.60 (₱1.92 per succeeding km).
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/80">
						<h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-mapa-green mb-2">
							Are students entitled to discounts on weekends and semestral breaks?
						</h4>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mapa-ink/85 leading-relaxed">
							Yes. Under Republic Act No. 11314 (Student Fare Discount Act), all enrolled Filipino students from elementary to technical and college levels are legally entitled to a 20% discount all 365 days of the year, including Saturdays, Sundays, holidays, and school vacation periods. Drivers or conductors cannot demand regular fare on non-school days.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/80">
						<h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-mapa-green mb-2">
							Why do Modern Jeepneys charge higher fares than Traditional Jeepneys?
						</h4>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mapa-ink/85 leading-relaxed">
							Modern PUJs are manufactured to higher Philippine National Standards (PNS 2126:2017). They feature air conditioning, Euro-4 or pure electric powertrains, automatic fare collection readers, onboard CCTV security cameras, and GPS tracking. The higher tariff reflects these operational investments amortized by transport cooperatives.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/80">
						<h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-mapa-green mb-2">
							Can a jeepney or bus driver reject a ₱500 or ₱1,000 bill?
						</h4>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mapa-ink/85 leading-relaxed">
							Philippine banknotes are legal tender, but the LTFRB requests commuters to provide reasonable denominations (₱20, ₱50, or ₱100 notes and coins) to avoid boarding delays. Drivers cannot refuse carriage, but tendering a ₱1,000 bill for a ₱14 minimum fare often leaves the conductor without sufficient change during early morning runs.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/80">
						<h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-mapa-green mb-2">
							How is city bus fare computed in Metro Manila?
						</h4>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mapa-ink/85 leading-relaxed">
							City buses use a 5-kilometer base distance. Ordinary (non-aircon) buses charge ₱15.00 for the first 5 km plus ₱2.49 for each succeeding kilometer (₱12.00 discounted base). Air-conditioned city buses charge ₱18.00 for the first 5 km plus ₱2.98 for each succeeding kilometer (₱14.50 rounded discounted base).
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 8: Editorial Notice -->
			<section class="mb-6 font-sans border-t border-mapa-contour/40 pt-6 text-xs text-mapa-clay not-prose">
				<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour mb-6">
					<h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-mapa-ink mb-3">
						Related Philippine Transit &amp; Mobility Calculators
					</h3>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
						<a href="/tools/rail-transit" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors block">
							<span class="font-bold text-mapa-green block mb-0.5">Metro Manila Rail Guide &rarr;</span>
							<span class="text-mapa-ink/75">Exact station-to-station LRT-1, LRT-2, and MRT-3 fares and transfer walkways.</span>
						</a>
						<a href="/tools/edsa-carousel" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors block">
							<span class="font-bold text-mapa-green block mb-0.5">EDSA Carousel Busway &rarr;</span>
							<span class="text-mapa-ink/75">24/7 median busway stop-by-stop fare matrix from Monumento to PITX.</span>
						</a>
						<a href="/tools/toll-calculator" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas border border-mapa-contour hover:border-mapa-green transition-colors block">
							<span class="font-bold text-mapa-green block mb-0.5">Expressway Toll Calculator &rarr;</span>
							<span class="text-mapa-ink/75">TRB Class 1, 2, and 3 toll tariffs across NLEX, SLEX, Skyway, SCTEX, and TPLEX.</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
					<span>Maintained by the <strong>mapaPH Civic Cartography &amp; Transit Initiative</strong>.</span>
					<span>Baseline Rates: LTFRB Official Nationwide Circulars.</span>
				</div>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	<Footer />

	<!-- Interactive Calculator Client Logic -->
	<script is:inline define:vars={{ FARE_RATES }}>
		(function () {
			const slider = document.getElementById('distance-slider');
			const numberInput = document.getElementById('distance-number-input');
			const label = document.getElementById('distance-display-label');
			const btnRegular = document.getElementById('btn-regular-fare');
			const btnDiscount = document.getElementById('btn-discount-fare');
			const discountSubtext = document.getElementById('discount-subtext');
			const presetBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.preset-btn');
			const presetTabs = document.querySelectorAll('.preset-tab');
			const fareCards = document.querySelectorAll('.fare-card');
			const copyToast = document.getElementById('copy-toast');
			const copyToastMsg = document.getElementById('copy-toast-msg');
			const btnCopyComparison = document.getElementById('btn-copy-comparison');

			// Ranker Elements
			const rankerCheapestName = document.getElementById('ranker-cheapest-name');
			const rankerCheapestDesc = document.getElementById('ranker-cheapest-desc');
			const rankerCheapestFare = document.getElementById('ranker-cheapest-fare');
			const rankerComfortName = document.getElementById('ranker-comfort-name');
			const rankerComfortDesc = document.getElementById('ranker-comfort-desc');
			const rankerComfortFare = document.getElementById('ranker-comfort-fare');
			const monthlyTrad = document.getElementById('monthly-trad');
			const monthlyModern = document.getElementById('monthly-modern');
			const monthlyBus = document.getElementById('monthly-bus');

			// Sukli Assistant Elements
			const sukliModeSelect = document.getElementById('sukli-mode-select');
			const sukliPassengers = document.getElementById('sukli-passengers');
			const sukliPassLabel = document.getElementById('sukli-pass-label');
			const sukliTotalFare = document.getElementById('sukli-total-fare');
			const sukliTenderedDisplay = document.getElementById('sukli-tendered-display');
			const sukliAmount = document.getElementById('sukli-amount');
			const sukliBreakdown = document.getElementById('sukli-breakdown');
			const sukliWarning = document.getElementById('sukli-large-bill-warning');
			const sukliCustomTender = document.getElementById('sukli-custom-tender');
			const tenderChips = document.querySelectorAll('.tender-chip');

			let isDiscount = false;
			let currentKm = 10.0;
			let currentTender = 100.0;

			function round25(val) {
				return Math.round(val * 4) / 4;
			}

			function calculateFare(modeKey, km, discount) {
				const conf = FARE_RATES[modeKey];
				const baseFare = discount ? conf.discountBase : conf.baseFare;
				const perKm = discount ? conf.discountPerKm : conf.perKm;
				const baseKm = conf.baseKm;

				if (km <= baseKm) {
					const roundedBase = round25(baseFare);
					return {
						total: roundedBase,
						math: `₱${roundedBase.toFixed(2)} flat (first ${baseKm} km)`
					};
				}

				const extraKm = km - baseKm;
				const extraCost = extraKm * perKm;
				const rawTotal = round25(baseFare + extraCost);

				return {
					total: rawTotal,
					math: `₱${baseFare.toFixed(2)} + ${extraKm.toFixed(1)} km × ₱${perKm.toFixed(2)}`
				};
			}

			function formatChangeBreakdown(cents) {
				if (cents === 0) return 'Exact payment handed. No change needed.';
				const denoms = [
					{ name: '₱500 bill', val: 50000 },
					{ name: '₱200 bill', val: 20000 },
					{ name: '₱100 bill', val: 10000 },
					{ name: '₱50 bill', val: 5000 },
					{ name: '₱20 bill', val: 2000 },
					{ name: '₱10 coin', val: 1000 },
					{ name: '₱5 coin', val: 500 },
					{ name: '₱1 coin', val: 100 },
					{ name: '25¢ coin', val: 25 }
				];
				let remaining = cents;
				const pieces = [];
				for (const d of denoms) {
					if (remaining >= d.val) {
						const count = Math.floor(remaining / d.val);
						remaining = remaining % d.val;
						pieces.push(`${count} × ${d.name}`);
					}
				}
				return pieces.length > 0 ? pieces.join(', ') : 'Exact amount';
			}

			function updateSukli() {
				if (!sukliModeSelect) return;
				const modeKey = sukliModeSelect.value;
				const passengers = parseInt(sukliPassengers.value, 10) || 1;
				const fareResult = calculateFare(modeKey, currentKm, isDiscount);
				const singleFare = fareResult.total;
				const totalFare = singleFare * passengers;

				sukliPassLabel.textContent = passengers === 1 ? '1 pax' : `${passengers} pax`;
				sukliTotalFare.textContent = `₱${totalFare.toFixed(2)}`;
				sukliTenderedDisplay.textContent = `₱${currentTender.toFixed(2)}`;

				const diff = round25(currentTender - totalFare);
				if (diff < 0) {
					sukliAmount.textContent = `-₱${Math.abs(diff).toFixed(2)}`;
					sukliAmount.className = 'text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-extrabold text-mapa-rust';
					sukliBreakdown.textContent = `Kulang po ng ₱${Math.abs(diff).toFixed(2)}. Please add more cash to cover the fare.`;
					sukliWarning.classList.add('hidden');
				} else {
					sukliAmount.textContent = `₱${diff.toFixed(2)}`;
					sukliAmount.className = 'text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-extrabold text-mapa-green';
					const diffInCents = Math.round(diff * 100);
					sukliBreakdown.textContent = formatChangeBreakdown(diffInCents);

					if (currentTender >= 500 && totalFare <= 100) {
						sukliWarning.classList.remove('hidden');
					} else {
						sukliWarning.classList.add('hidden');
					}
				}
			}

			function updateFares() {
				label.textContent = `${currentKm.toFixed(1)} km`;

				const modeFares = {};
				Object.keys(FARE_RATES).forEach((key) => {
					const res = calculateFare(key, currentKm, isDiscount);
					modeFares[key] = res.total;
					const fareEl = document.getElementById(`fare-${key}`);
					const mathEl = document.getElementById(`math-${key}`);

					if (fareEl) {
						fareEl.textContent = `₱${res.total.toFixed(2)}`;
					}
					if (mathEl) {
						mathEl.textContent = res.math;
					}
				});

				// Update Side-by-Side Commute Mode Ranker
				const tradFare = modeFares.tradJeep || 0;
				const modernFare = modeFares.modernJeep || 0;
				const airconBusFare = modeFares.airconBus || 0;

				// Cheapest PUV mode
				const cheapestKey = Object.keys(modeFares).reduce((minKey, key) =>
					modeFares[key] < modeFares[minKey] ? key : minKey
				, 'tradJeep');
				const cheapestFare = modeFares[cheapestKey];
				const cheapestConf = FARE_RATES[cheapestKey];
				const maxFare = Math.max(...Object.values(modeFares));
				const savings = Math.max(0, maxFare - cheapestFare);

				if (rankerCheapestName) {
					rankerCheapestName.textContent = cheapestConf.name;
					rankerCheapestFare.textContent = `₱${cheapestFare.toFixed(2)}`;
					rankerCheapestDesc.textContent = `Saves ₱${savings.toFixed(2)} compared to highest option (${maxFare.toFixed(2)}) for this distance.`;
				}

				if (rankerComfortName) {
					const diffOverTrad = Math.max(0, modernFare - tradFare);
					rankerComfortName.textContent = 'Modern PUJ (Aircon E-Jeep)';
					rankerComfortFare.textContent = `₱${modernFare.toFixed(2)}`;
					rankerComfortDesc.textContent = diffOverTrad > 0
						? `Adds only ₱${diffOverTrad.toFixed(2)} over traditional jeep for air-conditioning and safety.`
						: 'Equal or lower fare with air-conditioned comfort.';
				}

				// Monthly Budget Calculation (20 days × 2 trips = 40 trips)
				if (monthlyTrad) monthlyTrad.textContent = `₱${(tradFare * 40).toLocaleString('en-PH', { minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}`;
				if (monthlyModern) monthlyModern.textContent = `₱${(modernFare * 40).toLocaleString('en-PH', { minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}`;
				if (monthlyBus) monthlyBus.textContent = `₱${(airconBusFare * 40).toLocaleString('en-PH', { minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}`;

				// Highlight active row in 1–50 km matrix
				const roundedKm = Math.round(currentKm);
				document.querySelectorAll('[data-km-row]').forEach((row) => {
					const rKm = parseInt(row.getAttribute('data-km-row'), 10);
					if (rKm === roundedKm) {
						row.classList.add('bg-mapa-green/15', 'ring-1', 'ring-inset', 'ring-mapa-green');
					} else {
						row.classList.remove('bg-mapa-green/15', 'ring-1', 'ring-inset', 'ring-mapa-green');
					}
				});

				// Update Sukli assistant
				updateSukli();
			}

			// Distance input sync
			slider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				currentKm = parseFloat(e.target.value);
				numberInput.value = currentKm;
				updateFares();
			});

			numberInput.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				let val = parseFloat(e.target.value);
				if (isNaN(val) || val < 1) val = 1;
				if (val > 100) val = 100;
				currentKm = val;
				slider.value = Math.min(val, 70);
				updateFares();
			});

			// Discount toggle buttons
			btnRegular.addEventListener('click', () => {
				isDiscount = false;
				btnRegular.classList.add('bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold', 'shadow-xs');
				btnRegular.classList.remove('text-mapa-ink/80');
				btnDiscount.classList.remove('bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold', 'shadow-xs');
				btnDiscount.classList.add('text-mapa-ink/80');
				discountSubtext.textContent = 'Standard commuter passenger pricing under LTFRB guidelines.';
				updateFares();
			});

			btnDiscount.addEventListener('click', () => {
				isDiscount = true;
				btnDiscount.classList.add('bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold', 'shadow-xs');
				btnDiscount.classList.remove('text-mapa-ink/80');
				btnRegular.classList.remove('bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold', 'shadow-xs');
				btnRegular.classList.add('text-mapa-ink/80');
				discountSubtext.textContent = 'Mandatory 20% statutory discount for Students (RA 11314), Seniors (RA 9994), and PWDs.';
				updateFares();
			});

			// Preset buttons
			presetBtns.forEach((btn) => {
				btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
					const km = parseFloat(btn.getAttribute('data-km'));
					if (!isNaN(km)) {
						currentKm = km;
						slider.value = Math.min(km, 70);
						numberInput.value = km;
						updateFares();
					}
				});
			});

			// Preset Region Filter Tabs
			presetTabs.forEach((tab) => {
				tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
					const filter = tab.getAttribute('data-filter');
					presetTabs.forEach((t) => {
						t.classList.remove('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold');
						t.classList.add('bg-mapa-canvas', 'border', 'border-mapa-contour', 'text-mapa-ink/80');
					});
					tab.classList.add('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white', 'font-semibold');
					tab.classList.remove('bg-mapa-canvas', 'border', 'border-mapa-contour', 'text-mapa-ink/80');

					presetBtns.forEach((btn) => {
						const reg = btn.getAttribute('data-region');
						if (filter === 'all' || reg === filter) {
							btn.classList.remove('hidden');
						} else {
							btn.classList.add('hidden');
						}
					});
				});
			});

			// Sukli controls event listeners
			if (sukliModeSelect) {
				sukliModeSelect.addEventListener('change', updateSukli);
			}
			if (sukliPassengers) {
				sukliPassengers.addEventListener('change', updateSukli);
			}

			tenderChips.forEach((chip) => {
				chip.addEventListener('click', () => {
					tenderChips.forEach((c) => {
						c.classList.remove('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white');
						c.classList.add('bg-mapa-canvas-dark', 'text-mapa-ink');
					});
					chip.classList.add('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white');
					chip.classList.remove('bg-mapa-canvas-dark', 'text-mapa-ink');
					const val = parseFloat(chip.getAttribute('data-val'));
					currentTender = val;
					if (sukliCustomTender) sukliCustomTender.value = val;
					updateSukli();
				});
			});

			if (sukliCustomTender) {
				sukliCustomTender.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
					let val = parseFloat(e.target.value);
					if (isNaN(val) || val < 0) val = 0;
					currentTender = val;
					tenderChips.forEach((c) => {
						if (parseFloat(c.getAttribute('data-val')) === val) {
							c.classList.add('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white');
							c.classList.remove('bg-mapa-canvas-dark', 'text-mapa-ink');
						} else {
							c.classList.remove('active', 'bg-mapa-green', 'text-white');
							c.classList.add('bg-mapa-canvas-dark', 'text-mapa-ink');
						}
					});
					updateSukli();
				});
			}

			// Matrix row click & Jump to KM input
			document.querySelectorAll('[data-km-row]').forEach((row) => {
				row.addEventListener('click', () => {
					const km = parseInt(row.getAttribute('data-km-row'), 10);
					if (!isNaN(km)) {
						currentKm = km;
						slider.value = Math.min(km, 70);
						numberInput.value = km;
						updateFares();
					}
				});
			});

			const kmMatrixSearch = document.getElementById('km-matrix-search');
			if (kmMatrixSearch) {
				kmMatrixSearch.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
					const km = parseInt(e.target.value, 10);
					if (!isNaN(km) && km >= 1 && km <= 50) {
						currentKm = km;
						slider.value = km;
						numberInput.value = km;
						updateFares();
						const targetRow = document.getElementById(`matrix-km-row-${km}`);
						if (targetRow) {
							targetRow.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
						}
					}
				});
			}

			// Copy comparison button
			if (btnCopyComparison) {
				btnCopyComparison.addEventListener('click', async () => {
					const catName = isDiscount ? '20% Discounted (Student/Senior/PWD)' : 'Regular Adult';
					const trad = calculateFare('tradJeep', currentKm, isDiscount).total;
					const modern = calculateFare('modernJeep', currentKm, isDiscount).total;
					const ordBus = calculateFare('ordinaryBus', currentKm, isDiscount).total;
					const acBus = calculateFare('airconBus', currentKm, isDiscount).total;
					const uv = calculateFare('uvExpress', currentKm, isDiscount).total;

					const text = `Philippine Transit Fares (${currentKm.toFixed(1)} km - ${catName}):\n` +
						`• Traditional Jeepney: ₱${trad.toFixed(2)}\n` +
						`• Modern E-Jeepney: ₱${modern.toFixed(2)}\n` +
						`• Ordinary City Bus: ₱${ordBus.toFixed(2)}\n` +
						`• Aircon City Bus: ₱${acBus.toFixed(2)}\n` +
						`• Modern UV Express: ₱${uv.toFixed(2)}\n` +
						`Monthly Estimate (20 work days): ₱${(trad * 40).toFixed(0)} (Trad) vs ₱${(modern * 40).toFixed(0)} (Modern)\n` +
						`Official LTFRB 2026 Rates via mapaPH: https://www.mapaph.com/tools/fare-calculator`;

					try {
						await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
						copyToastMsg.textContent = `Copied 6-mode fare comparison for ${currentKm.toFixed(1)} km!`;
						copyToast.classList.remove('hidden');
						setTimeout(() => copyToast.classList.add('hidden'), 3500);
					} catch (err) {
						console.error('Clipboard copy failed:', err);
					}
				});
			}

			// Click fare card to copy breakdown & sync sukli selector
			fareCards.forEach((card) => {
				card.addEventListener('click', async () => {
					const modeKey = card.getAttribute('data-mode');
					if (sukliModeSelect) {
						sukliModeSelect.value = modeKey;
						updateSukli();
					}

					const conf = FARE_RATES[modeKey];
					const res = calculateFare(modeKey, currentKm, isDiscount);
					const catName = isDiscount ? '20% Discounted (Student/Senior/PWD)' : 'Regular Adult';

					const textToCopy = `${conf.name} Fare for ${currentKm.toFixed(1)} km: ₱${res.total.toFixed(2)} (${catName})\nComputation: ${res.math}\nStatutory Authority: LTFRB & DOTr (mapaph.com/tools/fare-calculator)`;

					try {
						await navigator.clipboard.writeText(textToCopy);
						copyToastMsg.textContent = `Copied ${conf.name} fare (₱${res.total.toFixed(2)}) to clipboard!`;
						copyToast.classList.remove('hidden');
						setTimeout(() => {
							copyToast.classList.add('hidden');
						}, 3500);
					} catch (err) {
						console.error('Clipboard copy failed:', err);
					}
				});
			});

			// Initial calculation
			updateFares();
		})();
	</script>
</BaseLayout>
